# Perilous Landscape: {T} adds {C} (turn 3, the pool shows one colorless). "Cycling {U}{R}{W}" (CR 702.29): on turn 1 the
# second Landscape in hand is discarded for the Moxen's {U}{R}{W} and Bot1 draws a card - Lightning Bolt, the card after
# the draw step's Forest - so the Landscape is in the graveyard and the Bolt in hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Perilous Landscape
Perilous Landscape
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Forest x2
Forest
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

